TAIL CERTIFICATE
  For q>=17, 24/(7q) <= 24/119 (0.201680672) < 0.21.
  Therefore the elementary crude bound alone makes every q>=17 resonance tail safe.
  Exact D for 5<=q<=16 is already below 0.21, so only q<=4 needs p0_inf atlas checks.

SYNTHESIS
  HYP-2730's sharp 12/7 constant is excellent, but L7 does not need it.
  A simple seven-bin lattice discrepancy bound plus finite q<=16 D-checks leaves
  the same small rational atlas and is a cleaner formalization target.
